flowchart TD
    A[Project Initiation] --> B{Stakeholder Approval?}
    B -->|No| C[Revise Proposal]
    B -->|Yes| D[Form Project Team]
    C --> A
    
    D --> E[Define Requirements]
    E --> F[Technical Analysis]
    F --> G[Architecture Design]
    G --> H[Technology Selection]
    
    H --> I{Budget Approved?}
    I -->|No| J[Cost Optimization]
    I -->|Yes| K[Development Planning]
    J --> H
    
    K --> L[Sprint 1: Core Framework]
    L --> M[Sprint 2: Authentication]
    M --> N[Sprint 3: User Management]
    N --> O[Sprint 4: Data Models]
    O --> P[Sprint 5: API Development]
    
    P --> Q[Integration Testing]
    Q --> R{Tests Pass?}
    R -->|No| S[Bug Fixes]
    R -->|Yes| T[User Acceptance Testing]
    S --> Q
    
    T --> U{UAT Approved?}
    U -->|No| V[Address Feedback]
    U -->|Yes| W[Deployment Preparation]
    V --> T
    
    W --> X[Staging Environment]
    X --> Y[Performance Testing]
    Y --> Z{Performance OK?}
    Z -->|No| AA[Optimization]
    Z -->|Yes| BB[Production Deployment]
    AA --> Y
    
    BB --> CC[Monitoring Setup]
    CC --> DD[Documentation]
    DD --> EE[Training Materials]
    EE --> FF[Team Training]
    
    FF --> GG[Go-Live]
    GG --> HH[Post-Launch Support]
    HH --> II[Performance Monitoring]
    II --> JJ{Issues Found?}
    JJ -->|Yes| KK[Issue Resolution]
    JJ -->|No| LL[Regular Maintenance]
    KK --> II
    
    LL --> MM[Feature Requests]
    MM --> NN{New Features?}
    NN -->|Yes| OO[Change Request]
    NN -->|No| PP[Status Quo]
    OO --> E
    
    PP --> QQ[Quarterly Review]
    QQ --> RR{Continue Project?}
    RR -->|Yes| LL
    RR -->|No| SS[Project Closure]
    
    SS --> TT[Knowledge Transfer]
    TT --> UU[Asset Documentation]
    UU --> VV[Final Report]
    VV --> WW[Project Archive]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style GG fill:#c8e6c9
    style SS fill:#ffcdd2
    style WW fill:#f3e5f5